2
00:46:25.786 --> 00:46:30.386
Hallelujah! Praise and name of Jesus. Hallelujah!

3
00:46:32.506 --> 00:46:37.586
Give each other a hand. Welcome each other in the church of Jesus Christ.

4
00:46:37.586 --> 00:46:41.346
Welcome each other. Get to know each other for a moment.

5
00:46:41.346 --> 00:46:44.586
Give each other a hug. Welcome.

6
00:46:48.466 --> 00:46:51.946
Maybe you see a few guests you have never seen before.

7
00:46:51.946 --> 00:46:55.746
Welcome each other in the name of Jesus.

8
00:47:22.426 --> 00:47:26.506
All the people who are guests here today. Maybe you are here for the first time.

9
00:47:26.506 --> 00:47:29.706
Raise your hand. All guests.

10
00:47:29.706 --> 00:47:34.266
Make some applause for all the people who are guests today in Open Church.

11
00:47:39.066 --> 00:47:45.266
You are warmly welcome in this church. A church where Jesus Christ is central. Amen.

12
00:47:46.266 --> 00:47:52.066
Debbie, I invite you to come up. Debbie is going to share something about today's offering.

13
00:47:52.066 --> 00:47:56.266
And I want to say in advance, if you call this church your home,

14
00:47:56.266 --> 00:48:01.866
if Open Church is your home church, the church where you have settled yourself,

15
00:48:01.866 --> 00:48:05.266
then this teaching on the offering is for you.

16
00:48:05.266 --> 00:48:08.666
If you are a guest here, feel no obligation whatsoever.

17
00:48:08.666 --> 00:48:12.266
Because giving is something you do with a joyful heart. Amen? Amen.

18
00:48:15.266 --> 00:48:21.466
Let’s read together in Acts 2, verse 44. Look at what it says there.

19
00:48:21.466 --> 00:48:25.866
The people who believed in Jesus came together.

20
00:48:25.866 --> 00:48:29.666
They also shared everything they had with each other.

21
00:48:29.666 --> 00:48:34.666
Time and again there were people who sold their cattle and their belongings

22
00:48:34.666 --> 00:48:40.466
and then distributed some money to the poor people.

23
00:48:40.466 --> 00:48:43.866
Every day they were united in the temple.

24
00:48:43.866 --> 00:48:49.466
They ate their meals together with gladness and unity.

25
00:48:49.466 --> 00:48:53.866
They praised God and everyone had respect for them.

26
00:48:53.866 --> 00:48:59.266
And the Lord made the group of people who were saved grow larger every day.

27
00:48:59.266 --> 00:49:05.466
How great is this passage? When I read this passage, I take a few things from it.

28
00:49:05.466 --> 00:49:13.066
Namely, they believe together and they eat together.

29
00:49:13.066 --> 00:49:16.066
That's also funny, we all do that here today.

30
00:49:16.066 --> 00:49:20.866
We believe together, because otherwise you wouldn't be sitting here at Christmas.

31
00:49:20.866 --> 00:49:25.066
We are going to eat together, that's nice too.

32
00:49:25.066 --> 00:49:30.666
They went to the temple together, we go to church together.

33
00:49:30.666 --> 00:49:34.466
Together they are joyful, they are joyful and united.

34
00:49:34.466 --> 00:49:39.866
Well, I think you are also sitting here happily, right? It's Christmas, it's a celebration.

35
00:49:39.866 --> 00:49:45.866
And together they praise God. We just did that too.

36
00:49:45.866 --> 00:49:49.466
Was that something? And together they share.

37
00:49:49.466 --> 00:49:52.866
They shared with each other and with the poor.

38
00:49:52.866 --> 00:49:55.666
And that is something we are going to do today as well.

39
00:49:55.666 --> 00:49:58.466
The Christmas collection is always a special collection.

40
00:49:58.466 --> 00:50:03.466
And today the Christmas collection will specifically be for the Food Bank in Lommel.

41
00:50:03.466 --> 00:50:06.866
We have very warm contacts with them.

42
00:50:06.866 --> 00:50:12.266
We go there regularly, we already give them a few things regularly.

43
00:50:12.266 --> 00:50:15.866
But today we are going to collect a special offering.

44
00:50:15.866 --> 00:50:21.666
And that is for the setup of the Food Bank.

45
00:50:21.666 --> 00:50:24.866
Namely, what is more fun than shopping?

46
00:50:24.866 --> 00:50:26.866
In a warehouse?

47
00:50:26.866 --> 00:50:31.866
