48
00:50:31.866 --> 00:50:34.666
With stalls. Yes, the latter.

49
00:50:34.666 --> 00:50:39.666
I have a few pictures of the Food Bank as it looks now.

50
00:50:39.666 --> 00:50:42.666
This is the bread section.

51
00:50:42.666 --> 00:50:44.666
Next one.

52
00:50:44.666 --> 00:50:46.666
This is the vegetable section.

53
00:50:46.666 --> 00:50:48.666
And the next one.

54
00:50:48.666 --> 00:50:51.666
Yes, these are the freezers and refrigerators.

55
00:50:51.666 --> 00:50:54.666
Not very convenient as you can see.

56
00:50:54.666 --> 00:50:56.666
You can't see what's inside.

57
00:50:56.666 --> 00:51:01.666
It's actually not fun to shop when you're there.

58
00:51:01.666 --> 00:51:04.666
But it is very necessary for a lot of people.

59
00:51:04.666 --> 00:51:08.666
It could be your neighbors who have to shop there.

60
00:51:08.666 --> 00:51:16.666
And we would love to collect a really big offering today.

61
00:51:16.666 --> 00:51:19.666
I just call it as it is.

62
00:51:19.666 --> 00:51:24.666
To raise a very large collection to be able to replace these things.

63
00:51:24.666 --> 00:51:26.666
You also see an old little table standing there and so on.

64
00:51:26.666 --> 00:51:30.666
And that one back from the vegetable section.

65
00:51:30.666 --> 00:51:33.666
That is actually not how you present vegetables.

66
00:51:33.666 --> 00:51:35.666
That is not fun shopping.

67
00:51:35.666 --> 00:51:40.666
And we find it so important that this is also done beautifully.

68
00:51:40.666 --> 00:51:42.666
So we really want to invest together.

69
00:51:42.666 --> 00:51:48.666
We will also consult with them about which shelves and such.

70
00:51:48.666 --> 00:51:50.666
So we want to do this.

71
00:51:50.666 --> 00:51:53.666
May I have the QR codes?

72
00:51:53.666 --> 00:51:55.666
How can you give from there?

73
00:51:55.666 --> 00:51:57.666
You can transfer via the bank.

74
00:51:57.666 --> 00:52:00.666
Just put it under Christmas collection or food bank.

75
00:52:00.666 --> 00:52:01.666
It will be just fine.

76
00:52:01.666 --> 00:52:03.666
You can also give with the app.

77
00:52:03.666 --> 00:52:05.666
There are cards on the chairs.

78
00:52:05.666 --> 00:52:07.666
There is also a QR code on it.

79
00:52:07.666 --> 00:52:08.666
You can also include that.

80
00:52:08.666 --> 00:52:10.666
Both Tikkie and Peconic.

81
00:52:10.666 --> 00:52:11.666
And via the app.

82
00:52:11.666 --> 00:52:14.666
If you go into the app, you can scroll for a moment.

83
00:52:14.666 --> 00:52:16.666
And then the Christmas collection is there.

84
00:52:16.666 --> 00:52:21.666
And then we also know that it will end up in the right place.

85
00:52:21.666 --> 00:52:24.666
You know, together we can make a difference.

86
00:52:24.666 --> 00:52:25.666
In this time.

87
00:52:25.666 --> 00:52:27.666
As that Bible verse said.

88
00:52:27.666 --> 00:52:29.666
Together they share everything.

89
00:52:29.666 --> 00:52:30.666
Together they were happy.

90
00:52:30.666 --> 00:52:33.666
Together they praise God.

91
00:52:33.666 --> 00:52:35.666
Let us do that today as well.

92
00:52:35.666 --> 00:52:39.666
And let us astonish the food bank.

93
00:52:39.666 --> 00:52:42.666
How warm-heartedly we contribute to them.

94
00:52:42.666 --> 00:52:43.666
Amen.

95
00:52:50.666 --> 00:52:52.666
Are you ready for the Word of God?

96
00:52:52.666 --> 00:52:53.666
Yes.

97
00:52:54.666 --> 00:52:55.666
Hallelujah.

98
00:52:57.666 --> 00:52:58.666
If you have your Bible with you.

99
00:52:58.666 --> 00:53:01.666
Please turn with me to Isaiah chapter 9.

100
00:53:01.666 --> 00:53:04.666
And everyone says of course.

101
00:53:04.666 --> 00:53:07.666
Isaiah chapter 9.

102
00:53:07.666 --> 00:53:09.666
Praise God.

103
00:53:15.666 --> 00:53:17.666
Christmas is about Jesus.

104
00:53:18.666 --> 00:53:20.666
And I'm not going to beat around the bush.

105
00:53:20.666 --> 00:53:22.666
You need Jesus.

106
00:53:22.666 --> 00:53:24.666
Jesus is my Savior.

107
00:53:24.666 --> 00:53:26.666
And I love Jesus.

108
00:53:26.666 --> 00:53:31.666
My life would look very different if I hadn't had Jesus.

109
00:53:31.666 --> 00:53:37.666
Your life would look very different if you hadn't had Jesus.

110
00:53:37.666 --> 00:53:39.666
And if you don't know Jesus yet.

111
00:53:39.666 --> 00:53:43.666
Jesus in your life makes your life so much better.

112
00:53:43.666 --> 00:53:46.666
The fact that you are breathing is because of Him.

113
00:53:46.666 --> 00:53:49.666
But He also wants to have a relationship with you.

114
00:53:49.666 --> 00:53:56.666
Jesus is literally where the solution to everything that is happening in life lies.

115
00:53:56.666 --> 00:54:02.666
And I made a pact with myself years ago that I want to keep shouting this throughout my whole life.

116
00:54:02.666 --> 00:54:04.666
You need Jesus.

117
00:54:04.666 --> 00:54:06.666
Jesus is King.

118
00:54:06.666 --> 00:54:08.666
He is the Creator of heaven and earth.

119
00:54:08.666 --> 00:54:10.666
Jesus is King.

120
00:54:10.666 --> 00:54:12.666
He is the Creator of heaven and earth.

121
00:54:12.666 --> 00:54:15.666
And he is not only Creator, he is also Savior.

122
00:54:15.666 --> 00:54:18.666
And he is not only Savior, he is also Lord.

123
00:54:18.666 --> 00:54:22.666
I worship the name of Jesus, I have agreed with myself, for the rest of my life.

124
00:54:22.666 --> 00:54:28.666
You will never see me go anywhere else but only to the cross and to Jesus.

125
00:54:28.666 --> 00:54:30.666
Can I get an amen on that?

126
00:54:30.666 --> 00:54:33.666
Isaiah chapter 9 says the following words.

127
00:54:33.666 --> 00:54:36.666
Read along with me if you have brought your own Bible.

128
00:54:36.666 --> 00:54:42.666
For otherwise it says here on the screen, the people who walk in darkness will see a great light.

129
00:54:42.666 --> 00:54:47.666
A light will shine again for the people who lived right at the gates of death.

130
00:54:47.666 --> 00:54:49.666
You have made the people great again.

131
00:54:49.666 --> 00:54:52.666
You have made the people joyful again.

132
00:54:52.666 --> 00:54:59.666
The people celebrate just as joyfully as at a harvest festival or when dividing a great spoil.

133
00:54:59.666 --> 00:55:09.666
For the yoke that was heavy on their shoulders, the rods on their backs, and the staff that was used to strike them have been broken by you.

134
00:55:09.666 --> 00:55:13.666
It will be a deliverance like in the old days when the Midianites were defeated.

135
00:55:13.666 --> 00:55:19.666
All the stomping soldier boots and all the blood-stained soldier clothes will be burned.

136
00:55:19.666 --> 00:55:22.666
They will be thrown into the fire.

137
00:55:22.666 --> 00:55:25.666
For a child has been born.

138
00:55:25.666 --> 00:55:27.666
We have received a king's son.

139
00:55:27.666 --> 00:55:30.666
He will reign as king.

140
00:55:30.666 --> 00:55:36.666
He is called Wonderful Counselor, Mighty God, Everlasting Father, and Prince of Peace.

141
00:55:36.666 --> 00:55:42.666
He will reign forever and in his kingdom there will be eternal peace.

142
00:55:42.666 --> 00:55:44.666
People, do you see what is written there?

143
00:55:44.666 --> 00:55:51.666
He will reign forever and in his kingdom there will be eternal peace.

144
00:55:51.666 --> 00:55:56.666
He will reign fairly and justly over the kingdom of King David.

145
00:55:56.666 --> 00:55:58.666
Forever.

146
00:55:58.666 --> 00:56:04.666
The Lord of hosts will do this because He loves His people so incredibly much.

147
00:56:04.666 --> 00:56:06.666
Can I get an amen on this?

148
00:56:08.666 --> 00:56:12.666
That Prince of Peace, let's talk about Him, His name is Jesus.

149
00:56:12.666 --> 00:56:18.666
And I have four lessons for you today, in which I simply want to say very clearly, you need Jesus.

150
00:56:18.666 --> 00:56:22.666
You need Jesus, you need Jesus, and you need Jesus.

151
00:56:22.666 --> 00:56:27.666
What we just read from Isaiah, that is a prophecy from the Old Testament,

152
00:56:27.666 --> 00:56:32.666
written about 730 years before Christ.

153
00:56:34.666 --> 00:56:39.666
It is such a bizarre time in which Isaiah writes this prophecy.

154
00:56:39.666 --> 00:56:45.666
It is a time of, as Isaiah describes here, the people living in darkness.

155
00:56:46.666 --> 00:56:51.666
In 730 before Christ, it was simply a turbulent time.

156
00:56:51.666 --> 00:56:59.666
There was war, the Assyrians were coming in, they were invading Israel, they were about to take Israel away.

157
00:56:59.666 --> 00:57:04.666
Assyria came in, it was one big war, there was war in the world.

158
00:57:04.666 --> 00:57:09.666
I don't know, when I look around me in the world today, I also see war around me.

159
00:57:10.666 --> 00:57:15.666
So on one hand, in the northern part of the kingdom of Israel,

160
00:57:15.666 --> 00:57:19.666
it was difficult, there was fear, there was fear for the future.

161
00:57:19.666 --> 00:57:22.666
From which direction should we go? For there was indeed darkness,

162
00:57:22.666 --> 00:57:26.666
for Assyria was coming to take over Israel soon.

163
00:57:26.666 --> 00:57:31.666
In the south of the people was indeed the southern kingdom of Judah,

164
00:57:31.666 --> 00:57:34.666
and even there it was one big mess.

165
00:57:34.666 --> 00:57:38.666
You had a king there, and that king was named King Ahaz.

166
00:57:38.666 --> 00:57:42.666
And that king, to put it in a Christian way, from a podium on a Sunday morning in a Christmas service,

167
00:57:42.666 --> 00:57:45.666
was really a pancake of a guy.

168
00:57:48.666 --> 00:57:54.666
He was an evil king. He was a king who was so bizarre, so possessed by demons.

169
00:57:54.666 --> 00:57:58.666
Yes, I will talk about this on Christmas morning or at a Christmas service.

170
00:57:58.666 --> 00:58:02.666
This king was so possessed and was so backward in his mind,

171
00:58:02.666 --> 00:58:07.666
that he even made his own son walk through fire in honor of the god Moloch.

172
00:58:07.666 --> 00:58:10.666
He was just an occult guy. He was a bizarre guy.

173
00:58:10.666 --> 00:58:15.666
And this was a Jewish king. This should have been a king who worshipped God,

174
00:58:15.666 --> 00:58:17.666
as the Creator of heaven and earth.

175
00:58:17.666 --> 00:58:20.666
This should be a king who knew God.

176
00:58:20.666 --> 00:58:24.666
This should be a king who was on his knees to worship the Lord.

177
00:58:24.666 --> 00:58:28.666
This should be a king who guided the people closer to the king,

178
00:58:28.666 --> 00:58:30.666
instead of further away from the king.

179
00:58:30.666 --> 00:58:35.666
But what did this king do? Evil upon evil upon evil.

180
00:58:35.666 --> 00:58:39.666
And I don't want to be a fatalistic preacher on Sunday morning.

181
00:58:39.666 --> 00:58:44.666
Only when we look around us in this world, do I see the contrast,

182
00:58:44.666 --> 00:58:50.666
or when I see what happened in 730 BC, I don't see much different.

183
00:58:50.666 --> 00:58:54.666
The only thing I can say is that the world needs Jesus.

184
00:58:55.666 --> 00:58:59.666
Back then they needed Jesus. Now they need Jesus.

185
00:58:59.666 --> 00:59:01.666
Tomorrow they will need Jesus.

186
00:59:01.666 --> 00:59:05.666
And not only do I need Jesus, you need Jesus too.

187
00:59:05.666 --> 00:59:08.666
And many of us will say, yes I know that.

188
00:59:08.666 --> 00:59:10.666
And I have accepted Jesus into my life.

189
00:59:10.666 --> 00:59:13.666
But some of us have not yet accepted him into your life.

190
00:59:13.666 --> 00:59:16.666
And that is why I shout from a podium, you need him.

191
00:59:16.666 --> 00:59:22.666
For Isaiah chapter 9 says, there is indeed a dark world in which we live.

192
00:59:22.666 --> 00:59:26.666
And the only solution is King Jesus.

193
00:59:26.666 --> 00:59:30.666
This prophecy that we just read is about him.

194
00:59:30.666 --> 00:59:36.666
This prophecy was written 730 years before Christ.

195
00:59:36.666 --> 00:59:40.666
And Jesus fulfills all the descriptions of this prophecy.

196
00:59:40.666 --> 00:59:42.666
This is him. This is him.

197
00:59:42.666 --> 00:59:45.666
This is the one we have been waiting for.

198
00:59:45.666 --> 00:59:48.666
Here are the four lessons I want to briefly share with you.

199
00:59:48.666 --> 00:59:52.666
And I will just say it very clearly as a statement about us all.

200
00:59:52.666 --> 00:59:54.666
We have just read this piece.

201
00:59:54.666 --> 00:59:57.666
And here are the four callings that I want to proclaim over us.

202
00:59:57.666 --> 01:00:00.666
Jesus is the light in the darkness.

203
01:00:00.666 --> 01:00:04.666
I say it again, Jesus is the light in the darkness.

204
01:00:04.666 --> 01:00:10.666
John 1, verses 6 to 9 says, God sent a man, John the Baptist,

205
01:00:10.666 --> 01:00:14.666
he had to tell the people about the light.

206
01:00:14.666 --> 01:00:17.666
Through him they would be able to believe in the light.

207
01:00:17.666 --> 01:00:21.666
John was not the light himself, but he came to tell about the light.

208
01:00:21.666 --> 01:00:23.666
Do you see that big L?

209
01:00:23.666 --> 01:00:26.666
That big L represents the names of God Himself.

210
01:00:26.666 --> 01:00:28.666
In the Bible, we write that with a capital letter.

211
01:00:28.666 --> 01:00:31.666
But he came to tell about the light.

212
01:00:31.666 --> 01:00:35.666
For Jesus, who is the true light, was about to come.

213
01:00:35.666 --> 01:00:40.666
And he gives light to every person.

214
01:00:41.666 --> 01:00:47.666
I come to tell you that the moment you allow Jesus into your life, everything changes.

215
01:00:47.666 --> 01:00:49.666
You will see things differently.

216
01:00:49.666 --> 01:00:52.666
You will recognize the truth.

217
01:00:52.666 --> 01:00:55.666
For light illuminates.

218
01:00:55.666 --> 01:01:01.666
If something is dark, then you are just stumbling around in the dark in your life.

219
01:01:01.666 --> 01:01:06.666
I have experienced this myself over the years and many people in the church have experienced it themselves.

220
01:01:06.666 --> 01:01:09.666
If you live without Jesus, then you are just doing whatever.

221
01:01:09.666 --> 01:01:14.666
Then you literally grasp where in the darkness around you.

222
01:01:14.666 --> 01:01:17.666
But as soon as you accept Jesus into your life.

223
01:01:17.666 --> 01:01:21.666
Then when something has been dark, suddenly a lamp lights up.

224
01:01:21.666 --> 01:01:23.666
All at once you will see it.

225
01:01:23.666 --> 01:01:25.666
All at once you will understand it.

226
01:01:25.666 --> 01:01:27.666
All at once you see the solution.

227
01:01:27.666 --> 01:01:29.666
All at once you see what it’s all about.

228
01:01:29.666 --> 01:01:31.666
And every time again.

229
01:01:31.666 --> 01:01:33.666
Every time again when I read the Bible.

230
01:01:33.666 --> 01:01:35.666
Then I think.

231
01:01:35.666 --> 01:01:38.666
Yes, this is it.

232
01:01:38.666 --> 01:01:39.666
Yes.

233
01:01:39.666 --> 01:01:43.666
When I read the Bible in the spirit of the Lord.

234
01:01:43.666 --> 01:01:45.666
Then I read every time again.

235
01:01:45.666 --> 01:01:47.666
This is it.

236
01:01:47.666 --> 01:01:51.666
And I am talking about a document that is already thousands of years old.

237
01:01:51.666 --> 01:01:55.666
How is it possible that a document that old.

238
01:01:55.666 --> 01:01:58.666
That was written over a period of 1500 years.

239
01:01:58.666 --> 01:02:00.666
In different parts of the world.

240
01:02:00.666 --> 01:02:01.666
By different people.

241
01:02:01.666 --> 01:02:02.666
By different people.

242
01:02:02.666 --> 01:02:03.666
In different places.

243
01:02:03.666 --> 01:02:05.666
And everything comes together so well.

244
01:02:05.666 --> 01:02:06.666
That we have the Bible.

245
01:02:06.666 --> 01:02:08.666
And every time I read the Bible.

246
01:02:08.666 --> 01:02:09.666
